    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem green_60 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∃ c > (0 : ℝ),\n      ∀ (A : Finset ℕ),\n        (∀ a ∈ A, IsSquare a) →\n        2 ≤ A.card →\n          ((A + A).card : ℝ) ≥ (A.card : ℝ) ^ (1 + c)",
